Handoff Docs (local-only):

Partner / integration handoffs must NOT be committed to this public repo.

1. Filename convention (required)
   - Name handoff docs `*.handoff.md` (any directory)
   - Example: `docs/field-mapper-permapress.handoff.md`
   - Do NOT use public-looking names like `*_HANDOFF.md` or plain `docs/*.md`

2. Git ignore
   - `*.handoff.md` is ignored via @.gitignore
   - Optional: also place under `docs/private/` (also ignored)

3. Agent behavior
   - When writing a handoff, use the `*.handoff.md` name from the start
   - NEVER stage, commit, or PR handoff docs
   - If a commit/PR would include a handoff file, exclude it and warn the user
   - If renaming an existing handoff into convention, do not force-add ignored files
